Package: jarvis-voice-engines
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: pipewire-bin | pulseaudio-utils | alsa-utils
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Local speech engines for the Jarvis assistant
 whisper.cpp (speech recognition) and Piper (speech synthesis), run by
 jarvisd for push-to-talk and spoken replies. Audio never leaves the machine.
